# zip_fseek: stored (uncompressed) WinZip AES encrypted entries are seekable
features HAVE_CRYPTO
return 0
arguments encrypt.zzip  set_password foofoofoo  is_seekable 1  fopen encrypted  fseek 0 5 set  fread 0 5
file encrypt.zzip encrypt-aes128.zip
stdout
1: seekable
opened 'encrypted' as file 0
pted
end-of-inline-data
